@startuml StoreArchitecture
title Architecture of the online electronics store

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #4b5563
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #475569
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #fdecc8
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #b7791f

actor "Покупатель" as Customer
actor "Менеджер" as Manager

rectangle "WEB-интерфейс\nReact" as Web #f8fafc

rectangle "Backend API\nASP.NET Core" as Api #dbeafe

rectangle "Модульный монолит\nDDD + изолированная бизнес-логика" as Monolith #e0f2fe {
  rectangle "Каталог" as Catalog #ffffff
  rectangle "Корзина" as Cart #ffffff
  rectangle "Заказы" as Orders #ffffff
  rectangle "Склад" as Inventory #ffffff
  rectangle "Пользователи" as Users #ffffff
  rectangle "Уведомления" as Notifications #ffffff
}

database "PostgreSQL\nданные модулей" as Db

cloud "Email / SMTP" as Email

Customer -down-> Web
Manager -down-> Web
Web -right-> Api : HTTP / REST
Api -down-> Monolith

Monolith -right-> Db : чтение / запись

Cart -right-> Orders : оформление заказа
Orders -down-> Inventory : резервирование товара
Orders -right-> Notifications : события заказа
Users -right-> Notifications : регистрация
Notifications -down-> Email : отправка писем

Customer -[hidden]right- Manager
Web -[hidden]right- Api
Api -[hidden]right- Db
Db -[hidden]down- Email

note bottom of Monolith
  Каждый модуль содержит собственные правила
  и взаимодействует с другими модулями через события.
end note

@enduml
